d I/O</h2>","sentences":[{"en":"Async/Await and I/O","zh":"异步/等待和 I/O"}]},{"html_en":"<li><a href=\"async.html\">Async</a></li>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<li><a href=\"io-implementations.html\">Io Implementations</a></li>","sentences":[{"en":"Io Implementations","zh":"IO 实现"}]},{"html_en":"<li><a href=\"queue.html\">Queue</a></li>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<li><a href=\"file-system.html\">File System</a></li>","sentences":[{"en":"File System","zh":"文件系统"}]},{"html_en":"<li><a href=\"text-io.html\">Text I/O</a></li>","sentences":[{"en":"Text I/O","zh":"文本输入/输出"}]},{"html_en":"<li><a href=\"binary-io.html\">Binary I/O</a></li>","sentences":[{"en":"Binary I/O","zh":"二进制输入/输出"}]},{"html_en":"<h2>Comptime</h2>","sentences":[{"en":"Comptime","zh":"康泰姆"}]},{"html_en":"<li><a href=\"comptime.html\">Comptime</a></li>","sentences":[{"en":"Comptime","zh":"康泰姆"}]},{"html_en":"<li><a href=\"precomputed-data.html\">Precomputed Data</a></li>","sentences":[{"en":"Precomputed Data","zh":"预先计算的数据"}]},{"html_en":"<li><a href=\"generic-functions.html\">Generic Functions</a></li>","sentences":[{"en":"Generic Functions","zh":"通用函数"}]},{"html_en":"<li><a href=\"generic-types.html\">Generic Types</a></li>","sentences":[{"en":"Generic Types","zh":"通用类型"}]},{"html_en":"<li><a href=\"reflection.html\">Reflection</a></li>","sentences":[{"en":"Reflection","zh":"反射"}]},{"html_en":"<h2>Zig Tooling</h2>","sentences":[{"en":"Zig Tooling","zh":"之字形工具"}]},{"html_en":"<li><a href=\"build-system.html\">Build System</a></li>","sentences":[{"en":"Build System","zh":"构建系统"}]},{"html_en":"<h2>Zig and C</h2>","sentences":[{"en":"Zig and C","zh":"齐格和C"}]},{"html_en":"<li><a href=\"using-c.html\">Using C</a></li>","sentences":[{"en":"Using C","zh":"使用C"}]},{"html_en":"<li><a href=\"c-types.html\">C Types</a></li>","sentences":[{"en":"C Types","zh":"C型"}]},{"html_en":"<li><a href=\"time-and-date.html\">Time and Date</a></li>","sentences":[{"en":"Time and Date","zh":"时间和日期"}]},{"html_en":"<p>\n\t<a href=\"index.html\">Zig by Example</a>\n\t·\n\t<a href=\"about.html\">about</a>\n\t·\n\t<a href=\"https://codeberg.org/levin/zigbyexample\">source</a>\n</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Zig by Example · about · source","zh":"Zig 示例 · 关于 · 来源"}]}],"translated":true,"content_html_zh":"<div class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div>\n\n\n\n<p>Zig 是一种通用编程语言和工具链，用于维护健壮、优化和可重用的软件。 请阅读官方文档以了解更多信息。</p>\n\n<p>Zig by Example 是使用带注释的示例程序对 Zig 的实践介绍。</p>\n\n<p>这些示例是为 0.16 版本编写的。 如果出现问题，请检查您使用的是哪个版本。</p>\n\n\n<h2>入门</h2>\n<ul>\n\n<li>你好世界！</li>\n\n<li>格式化输出</li>\n\n<li>单元测试</li>\n\n<li>基本类型</li>\n\n<li>变量</li>\n\n<li>违法行为</li>\n\n<li>构建模式</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<h2>基本类型</h2>\n<ul>\n\n<li>整数</li>\n\n<li>整数运算符</li>\n\n<li>浮点数</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<h2>功能和错误</h2>\n<ul>\n\n<li>功能</li>\n\n<li>错误</li>\n\n<li>断言</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<h2>控制流程</h2>\n<ul>\n\n<li>如果语句</li>\n\n<li>Switch 语句</li>\n\n<li>While 循环</li>\n\n<li>For 循环</li>\n\n<li>积木</li>\n\n<li><a href=\"defer.html\">Defer</a></li>\n\n<li>埃尔德费尔</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<h2>复合类型</h2>\n<ul>\n\n<li>数组</li>\n\n<li>切片</li>\n\n<li>指针</li>\n\n<li>选项</li>\n\n<li>结构体</li>\n\n<li>元组</li>\n\n<li><a href=\"enums.html\">Enums</a></li>\n\n<li>工会</li>\n\n<li>标记工会</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<h2>标准库</h2>\n<ul>\n\n<li>分配器</li>\n\n<li>数组列表</li>\n\n<li>自动哈希映射</li>\n\n<li>字符串哈希映射</li>\n\n<li>哈希映射</li>\n\n<li>排序</li>\n\n<li>随机的</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<h2>命令行程序</h2>\n<ul>\n\n<li>论据</li>\n\n<li>环境变量</li>\n\n<li>退出状态</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<h2>异步/等待和 I/O</h2>\n<ul>\n\n<li><a href=\"async.html\">Async</a></li>\n\n<li>IO 实现</li>\n\n<li><a href=\"queue.html\">Queue</a></li>\n\n<li>文件系统</li>\n\n<li>文本输入/输出</li>\n\n<li>二进制输入/输出</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<h2>康泰姆</h2>\n<ul>\n\n<li>康泰姆</li>\n\n<li>预先计算的数据</li>\n\n<li>通用函数</li>\n\n<li>通用类型</li>\n\n<li>反射</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<h2>之字形工具</h2>\n<ul>\n\n<li>构建系统</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<h2>齐格和C</h2>\n<ul>\n\n<li>使用C</li>\n\n<li>C型</li>\n\n<li>时间和日期</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>Zig 示例 · 关于 · 来源</p>\n\n</div></div>"}